cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "OmniOmics Validation & Reproducibility Package"
message: "If you use this data/reproduction package, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: "Angelo Felipe"
    family-names: "Barbosa de Oliveira"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0831-447X"
    affiliation: "Programa de Pós-Graduação em Genética e Biologia Molecular, Universidade Federal do Pará (UFPA), Belém, PA, Brazil"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/oliv-angelus/OmniOmics-validation"
abstract: >-
  Real, non-dry-run validation of all five OmniOmics pipelines (MAGMA, SIGMA,
  DOGMA, DEFINE, PRISM) against public datasets with a known, published
  ground truth. Companion package to the OmniOmics tool paper's Deliverable
  B (see https://github.com/oliv-angelus/OmniOmics).
